    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Orator</strong>.</p><hr><p>During a conflict scene, you may use an action and choose a <strong>soldier</strong>-rank creature that can hear and understand you (the Game Master must tell you who is a valid target). If that creature is <strong>shaken</strong> or in <strong>Crisis</strong>, you may spend an amount of Mind Points equal to <strong>【20 + half that creature's level】</strong> to have them peacefully leave the conflict.</p><p>Describe how you convince them to desist.</p>",
